{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯をアップグレードして\nキーボードで文字を打つ時の\nクリック音が気持ちよくて\nサイレントモード解除しっぱなしで\n携帯を使ってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車の中では我慢して\nサイレントモードにしてるけど(｡ρω-｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山さんが教えてくださった\n高山さんの好きな曲をきいてから\nはまってしまった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても素敵なうた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かが好きな曲をきくのって\nわくわくする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は自分の好きな曲を\n誰かに言うのに少し照れてしまう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか恥ずかしい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかる人いるかな？\nこのきもち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山さんにもっといろいろな曲\nおしえてもらおー(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/06/6396326/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/06/6396326/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔女っ子！日奈っ子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/10/06/6396326/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"t